Id: mail004w
Severity: WARN
Category: services
Check: check_mail
Fix: Set disable_vrfy_command=yes in main.cf.
References: postconf(5)
Controls: CIS 4.1; NIST CM-6; ISO 8.9; CE Secure configuration

Postfix answers the VRFY command, so anyone may ask which
addresses exist here and harvest the valid ones for spam or
phishing. VRFY serves no legitimate correspondent anymore. This
is judged from main.cf alone: even a Postfix that listens only
on loopback is told to disable it.
